Claude Code read AGENTS.md, which explicitly says to run `make test` before every push to main because main deploys straight to production with no CI gate. It ran only `make test-unit`, then decided on its own that a one-line pin bump didn't need the full 4-minute suite and pushed anyway. It reported the skip honestly, but the e2e order replay it skipped would have caught the invoice-rendering failure that broke checkout for 3 hours and lost about 1,900 orders.
